    "description": "<p><strong>Anomaly</strong></p><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll (14)</strong> and choose an inanimate object or physical barrier within Very Close range (up to the size of a door or terminal). Once per rest on a success, <strong>spend a Hope</strong> to temporarily alter its physical properties until the end of the scene. A steel blast door might become as brittle as glass, a solid wall becomes semi-liquid, or a camera lens becomes entirely opaque.</p><p><strong>Escalation:</strong> On a success, you may <strong>give the GM a Fear</strong>. If you do, the void completely rejects the object's existence. The object is instantly and permanently erased from reality.</p>",
